# Patterns excluded from the HPC code tarball (tar --exclude-from) and
# also honoured by rsync (-avP --exclude-from).
#
# Rule of thumb: exclude anything that's dev-only, huge, secret, machine-local,
# or regenerable on the HPC side.
.git
.gitignore
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
.claude
.claude/settings.local.json
build
build/hpc_bundle
data
model
logs
wandb
AuthorKit27
visualisations
paper
docs/*.ipynb
docs/*.pdf
docs/hsi-pi-vae-v1.ipynb
docs/hsi-pi-vae-v2.ipynb
notebooks
inference/notebooks
